                'Automatic uses the cross-sells of the visitor\'s cart, then the upsells of the products in it. Set them on each WooCommerce product.' => __('Automatic uses the cross-sells of the visitor\'s cart, then the upsells of the products in it. Set them on each WooCommerce product.', 'zappoppop'),
                'The popup is not shown when no upsell is available, for example when the product is already in the cart or out of stock.' => __('The popup is not shown when no upsell is available, for example when the product is already in the cart or out of stock.', 'zappoppop'),
                'Give a button the link #zpp-add-upsell to add the product to the cart (the popup then closes), or #zpp-view-upsell to open its page. Variable products can only use the view link.' => __('Give a button the link #zpp-add-upsell to add the product to the cart (the popup then closes), or #zpp-view-upsell to open its page. Variable products can only use the view link.', 'zappoppop'),
                'Upsell product name' => __('Upsell product name', 'zappoppop'),
                'Upsell product price' => __('Upsell product price', 'zappoppop'),
'''),
